    summary: 'The residual stream is the running hidden state for each position. It is initialized by the token embedding and updated additively by each attention and MLP sublayer: `x ← x + f(norm(x))`. No sublayer replaces it; they all write into the same shared vector, which is why information from early layers remains available to late ones.',
